@prefix fd: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/frontier-derivative#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dqv: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dqv#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
fd:Candidate a skos:Concept .
fd:Hyperedge a skos:Concept .
fd:Derivative a dqv:Metric .
fd:unlocks a rdf:Property .
fd:requires a rdf:Property .
fd:reversible a rdf:Property .
fd:authority a rdf:Property .
fd:standing a rdf:Property .
fd:seed a fd:Candidate ; fd:reversible true ; fd:authority "SELECT" ; fd:standing "ALIVE" .
